    lore:
      "SUN is the Token Game's most reliable August coin — it rises every morning in the portfolio dashboard with a faint golden glow that Nation Solara's engineers insist is a deliberate design choice and Nation Vigil's engineers insist is a rendering bug. Both are probably right. SUN's price has never had a losing August in four seasons, a streak that Nation Solara's optimism bureau has framed and hung next to the HOPIUM analyst reports.",
