      "NAP is the only coin in The Stash that generates yield exclusively during periods when its holder is provably inactive — the smart contract monitors wallet activity and pays out only during confirmed idle windows of four hours or more. Nation Vigil's traders have attempted to automate fake inactivity to farm NAP yield. The contract detected this within six hours. Nation Lazara was not surprised.",
