    utility:
      "SCRATCHIE activates an instant-reveal mechanic once per October cycle — the holder scratches a random position to immediately reveal its end-of-cycle value, with a 1-in-10 chance of a 5x jackpot and a 9-in-10 chance of a small consolation prize. No position is a total loss.",
