    lore:
      "ROUGHIE is the Token Game's most improbable coin — it has the worst odds in the October rotation, the least impressive form, and the most enthusiastic holders, because everyone who has ever backed a roughie and watched it come home knows that no other feeling in the market compares. The 13 nations have agreed that ROUGHIE should remain in the rotation permanently, because a market without long shots is a market without dreams, and a market without dreams is just accounting.",
