    utility:
      "AUSSUNSCREEN provides a UV-protection passive in November — holders who apply AUSSUNSCREEN at the start of the cycle (i.e., hold it from day one) receive a 20% reduction in all heat-related damage events throughout the month, rewarding consistent protection over reactive treatment.",
