    lore:
      "BEACHXMAS is the Token Game's most seasonally specific coin — it only activates on Christmas Day in the December cycle, it only generates yield if the holder's wallet is inactive for the duration, and it rewards the complete, committed decision to be at the beach rather than at the screen. The 13 nations have described this as 'the hardest mechanic in the game for Nation Vigil's traders to complete.' Nation Australis has described it as 'obviously correct.'",
