    lore:
      "BONDI is the Token Game's most globally recognised Australian coin — it is the beach that everyone in the world knows, the one that appears in every Nation Australis promotional material, and the one that is, on Christmas Day, so crowded that finding a spot on the sand requires the same strategic patience as finding a good entry point in a bull market. The 13 nations have agreed that BONDI is worth the crowd.",
