    lore:
      "SUMMERFUN is the Token Game's most deliberately unserious December coin — it does not have a complex mechanic, it does not reward sophisticated analysis, and it does not care about your year-to-date performance. It is December, it is summer, and the only thing SUMMERFUN tracks is whether you are having a good time. The 13 nations have agreed that this is, in December, the correct metric.",
