      "FIREWORKS2 is the Token Game's most spectacular coin — it does nothing for 364 days and then, on July 4th, it explodes. The price chart for FIREWORKS2 looks like a fireworks display: a sudden vertical spike, a cascade of colour, and then a slow, beautiful descent back to earth. Traders who buy before the launch and sell at the peak have made some of the July rotation's most dramatic single-day returns. Traders who buy at the peak have provided the most dramatic single-day losses.",
