      "DOUFU was minted by Nation Zhongyuan's ancient foods exchange on the day they calculated that tofu had been feeding the nation for over two thousand years without once asking for recognition, a whitepaper, or a roadmap. The exchange minted it as the coin of the staple that has outlasted every trend, every dynasty, and every dietary fad in the 13 nations' combined history.",
