      "TANGYUAN2 is the Token Game's most seasonally doubled December coin — it carries the memory of TANGYUAN in its contract, and holders who have held both in the same seasonal arc receive a 'twice-round' bonus that Nation Zhongyuan's winter solstice kitchen describes as 'the financial expression of a year that began and ended with the family at the table, which is the correct shape for a year.' The sesame filling is the same. The broth is warmer in December. The reunion is the same reunion, six months later, which makes it both familiar and necessary.",
