    utility:
      "REUNION2 rewards full-year continuity during the December cycle — holders who also held REUNION during the January cycle receive a 'full year at the table' bonus that is the highest single-coin yield in the December rotation for those who earned it, because the year that began and ended with the family dinner is the year that deserves the largest reward.",
