      "HINA was minted by Nation Torii's doll-display exchange in late February, when the hina ningyo were carefully unwrapped from their tissue paper and arranged on the seven-tiered platform and The Stash's preparation oracle registered the most meticulous seasonal setup in Token Game history. The exchange minted it as the coin of the careful preparation for Girls' Day.",
