      "HINAMATSURI was minted by Nation Torii's Girls' Day exchange on March 3, when the hina doll platforms were illuminated with paper lanterns and the chirashizushi and hishi mochi were served and The Stash's celebration oracle registered the most elegantly feminine seasonal event in Token Game history. The exchange minted it as the coin of the day that belongs to the daughters of Japan.",
