    utility:
      "HANAMI yield scales with the number of simultaneous holders during the March-April cycle — the more traders picnicking together under the sakura, the higher the return for all of them. Solo HANAMI positions yield the base rate; a group of 13 or more (one per nation) unlocks the 'Full Blossom' bonus, because the best hanami is the one where everyone shows up.",
